@Store.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5076

### Crear pedido válido -> 201 (estado Pending)
POST {{Store.WebApi_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Ana", "sku": "ABC-01", "quantity": 2 }

### Datos inválidos -> 400 con errores por campo
POST {{Store.WebApi_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "", "sku": "NOPE-99", "quantity": 0 }

### Listar pedidos
GET {{Store.WebApi_HostAddress}}/orders

### Detalle (reemplazá el id por uno real)
GET {{Store.WebApi_HostAddress}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Liveness / Readiness
GET {{Store.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health/live

###
GET {{Store.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health/ready
